# FitOS architecture

- Own all business logic in `backend/domain`. Vendors only in `backend/adapters`.
- Never import Anthropic, Open Food Facts, USDA, HealthKit, or Health Connect from `apps/web` or `backend/domain`.
- Every food/prediction record must include `source`, `source_version`, and `confidence`.
- FastAPI routes: Pydantic validation + domain service call. No SQL or vendor calls in routes.
- No Strava. GPS is native geolocation, health stores, or GPX/FIT import.
- Web UI is a 5-tab mobile shell: Home, Workout, Nutrition, Activity, Profile (390–430px base).
